<title>JAPAN: Hino Motors up on Toyota share buying news.</title>
<headline>Hino Motors up on Toyota share buying news.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hino Motors Ltd rose in Tokyo morning trading on Tuesday on news that Toyota Motor Corp will increase its stake in the truck maker.</p>
<p>As of 0106 GMT, Hino Motors shares were up 28 yen at 750.</p>
<p>On Monday, Toyota said that it plans to raise its stake in Hino Motors Ltd to 16.4 percent from 11.1 percent by buying an additional 19.3 million shares in Hino in an attempt to achieve closer cooperation in the business of small trucks.</p>
</text>
